      "value": "@{58c6cbcffd04b1785f747b6c|full_name}: To be honest, I always felt it was odd that your Pug is so well made and professional, but whenever everyone joins your room at the same time from a portal, we all spawn on top of each other...  You really should make a few spawn spots in that loading area so people spawn separated a bit. Would at just a bit more polish to your great room.",
